# Project Sunday — agent context

This file used to carry a full project description. It went stale — it
described executors as stubs long after they were built — and a context file
that lies is worse than no context file.

The current sources of truth, both kept accurate:

- **[README.md](./README.md)** — architecture, memory layers, approval tiers,
  layout, how to run it, standing constraints.
- **[ROADMAP.md](./ROADMAP.md)** — what is built, what is not, what is next,
  and known issues.

Read those two first. If either is wrong, correct it there rather than starting
a third document — three overlapping roadmaps is exactly the state this
repository is recovering from.
